            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# PortDeck 0.1.0-beta.19

- Opens local HTTPS services with the correct URL on any port, including services using self-signed development certificates.
- Keeps ordinary HTTP services working and bounds HTTPS detection requests.
- Adds a LOCAL badge in the upper-right header of source-development builds, with the version shown on hover.
]]></description>
